    "updated_at": "2022-02-21T21:09:37Z",
    "body": "I think a circled \"S\" (![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20801821/155026451-d405198b-cc22-4245-b54f-16de22a9291a.png)) or a squared \"S\" (![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20801821/155026496-c582bd02-8487-4034-bc76-7cea60ccbd11.png)) could work well. Preference would probably be for the circle to keep it similar to the `conda` icon, but I'm up for either.",
